        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "The team at sylvain Ménard are professional and very patient with us. They were fair & have respected everything they’ve said thus far regarding our home being built. We’re very satisfied with the product & the work being done. We have a great Forman & an exceptional real estate agent.",
