      },
      {
        "author_name": "stacy st.pierre",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103258737073897220632/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJPtEugpNESYDan4vEUHJxMUIaUFYWCKVhWwZakyLRyNf8OmA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "7 year old roof shingles flew off under light wind conditions. Shingle manufacturers recommend nails be 1 inch from the sides. As you can see in the picture attached,  this is not the case. After contacting the builder, they refused to come and check to see if there are other shingles not properly installed. They also installed the wrong color sidding than the one we originally chose but at the end of the day \"it's just a color\" right!? The last 2 photos  you can see they used calking instead of brick grout or mortar.\nP.S. Please note that the opinions expressed in this comment are solely my own and do not represent me. This comment is based on personal experiences and perceptions. It is important to exercise your own judgment and conduct further research before making any decisions or forming any opinions based on this comment. Furthermore, this comment is not intended to defame or harm the reputation of any individual or entity. If you have any concerns or grievances, it is recommended to address them through appropriate channels or seek legal advice.",
        "time": 1684423687,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "LAURENCE IRAGENA",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104076405105870023276/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVdtP5Yemov92A7cGlXgleqQrnlFzgCwWCNJ6pNljbI26E8IzA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "6 months ago",
        "text": "Me et my family. Deeply we want to say thank you to the Habitations Sylvain Menard for their professionnalisme in everything.. recently we have been starting living in the house bought with them ..everything is like how they promised and on time basis.  expecially the time of delivery of the house. We also appreciate the after sale service cz once you call , they came immediately to check and explain to you everything.  Particularly, thank you Mme Sophie Prudhomme whom was with us during the whole process. Thank you so much and we highly recommend your company",
        "time": 1755097207,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Ken Chin",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101117850893388450636/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJfEzIesSdkiBmpPvSewMQo8iXXaYEpIyfTi4uK8T4YoBw1yg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "7 months ago",
        "text": "We are very happy with this builder. Quality and professionalism stands out. Rhoida Ilagan the agent was really great to work with all along the process. As experienced homeowners, we knew exactly what we wanted and Rhoida was key in making it happen. She is very knowledgeable, helpful, well organized and responsive. Many thanks to our foreman François Aumais as well. We got everything we wanted in our small house, couldn’t be happier.",
        "time": 1751638427,
        "translated": false
      }
